# Where "ENTER THE GAME" sends visitors. Read at build time by Vite.
# Leave empty while the game application is not deployed: the site then shows
# its "world is being prepared" entry state instead of a link.
# When the game is live, set it to the game's own deployment, for example:
#   VITE_GAME_URL=https://play.scammaze.com
VITE_GAME_URL=
